    "text": "If <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>&nbsp;+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then"
